    <briefdescription>
<para>A POD-like structure that we use to store a global reference together with its metadata types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In this pass we frequently need to query the set of metadata types referenced by a global, which at the IR level is an expensive operation involving a map lookup; this data structure helps to reduce the number of times we need to do this lookup. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
